==Strategy==
This stage is quite easy. All you need to win is [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], meatshields, and a Research [[Cat Combo]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. There are two ways to attack this stage: either rush it with Awakened Bahamut, or spam [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], Courier Cat, [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and any ranged units or ubers. If your units are underlevelled, let the first J.J. Jackrabbit hit the base to build up a bit of cash.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[:Category:Super-Backliner-class Cats|Super-backliners]]: Examples include [[Child of Destiny Phono (Uber Rare Cat)|Phonoa]] and [[Sea Serpent Daliasan (Uber Rare Cat)|Sea King Daliasan]].
*[[Immortal Yukimura]]: An anti-Dark Rusher that can do [[Massive Damage]] to Darkjo.

